<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing rated strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing rated strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it reinitiated coverage of Boeing Co and BE Aerospace Inc.</p>
<p>-- Restarted Boeing as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Restarted BE Aerospace as outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- BE Aerospace shares rose 1/16 to 24-15/16 and Boeing rose 6-3/4 to 103-1/2 in early activity.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
